* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for SG2M035120LJ: drain ramp 0..800 V, gate held at -4.0 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=2.8 Kp=9 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.02469 Rs=0.5m Rg=2.9 Cgs=1.836e-09 Cgdmax=3.686e-10 Cgdmin=6.6e-12 a=0.04847 Cjo=1.744e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.04906 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 -4.0
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 800.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_SG2M035120LJ.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
